Too institutional.

532
00:34:27.565 --> 00:34:28.691
I love green.

533
00:34:28.775 --> 00:34:33.196
I love it but it's one thing to wear it
and another to have it on your walls.

534
00:34:36.366 --> 00:34:39.911
