Do what you want.

535
00:34:43.289 --> 00:34:45.958
Remember, it's only a health-code case.

536
00:35:07.563 --> 00:35:11.693
This is the first time since I was 13,
I don't have a job...

537
00:35:12.610 --> 00:35:13.945
...or two.

538
00:35:14.529 --> 00:35:16.864
